    {
      "example": "{\"name\":\"王先生\",\"time\":\"19点20分\",\"address\":\"某某中心\"}",
      "help_en": "The contact flow variables passed in as a JSON-formatted string of an array. Each array element is a key-value pair, where the key is the variable name and the value is the variable value. To use these variables in the IVR flow, create a Custom Parameter with the same name in the start node of the IVR associated with the specified contact flow ID",
      "help_zh": "传入的联系流变量，格式为JSON数组的字符串，数组元素是一个键值对，Key为变量名，Value为变量值。在联系流ID对应的IVR的开始节点中新建同名的自定义参数，即可在IVR流程中使用该参数",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "contact_flow_variables",
      "options": [
        "--contact-flow-variables"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ContactFlowVariables",
      "required": false,
